---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Changelog | Shellui
description: "Release notes for each Shellui version: features, fixes, and breaking changes across the shell, SDK, identity, admin, and storage."
eyebrow: Developers
heading: What changed in each release
lede: Shellui 0.5.0 is the latest release. Features, fixes, and breaking changes across the shell, SDK, identity, admin, and storage.
prose: false
---
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:gap-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5">
  <div class="min-w-0">
    <p class="text-base text-gray-900 dark:text-white">v0.5.0 · 16 September 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Chrome actions SDK, new <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-xs dark:bg-gray-800">shellui init</code> frameworks, OKLCH themes, inset layouts, CLI companion, and identity-hosted login.</p>
  </div>
  <a
    href="https://github.com/shellui/shellui/releases/tag/v0.5.0"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-gray-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:border-gray-600 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
  >
    GitHub release
  </a>
</div>

{% if changelog.length == 0 %}
<p class="mt-10 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Changelog is unavailable. Check GitHub or try again later.</p>
{% endif %}
<div class="mt-10" x-data="{ allOpen: false }">
<div class="mb-4 flex justify-end">
  <button type="button" class="min-h-11 rounded-md px-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary" @click="allOpen = !allOpen; $dispatch('toggle-all', { open: allOpen })" x-text="allOpen ? 'Collapse all' : 'Expand all'"></button>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
{% for release in changelog %}
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/[0.02]" x-data="{ show: {{ 'true' if loop.first else 'false' }} }" @toggle-all.window="show = $event.detail.open">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="flex w-full min-h-11 items-center gap-4 px-6 py-3 text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
      @click="show = !show"
      :aria-expanded="show.toString()"
      aria-controls="changelog-{{ loop.index }}"
      id="changelog-trigger-{{ loop.index }}"
    >
      <span class="inline-flex w-24 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-ink/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-bold tabular-nums text-primary-ink dark:bg-primary/15 dark:text-primary">v{{ release.version }}</span>
      <span class="w-28 shrink-0 text-sm tabular-nums text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">{{ release.date if release.date else '' }}</span>
      <span class="flex-1"></span>
      {% if loop.first %}
        <span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-green-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-green-700 dark:bg-green-500/10 dark:text-green-400">Latest</span>
      {% endif %}
      <svg class="mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none" :class="show && 'rotate-180'" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
      </svg>
    </button>
    <div id="changelog-{{ loop.index }}" x-show="show" role="region" aria-labelledby="changelog-trigger-{{ loop.index }}">
      <div class="space-y-4 border-t border-gray-100 px-6 pb-4 dark:border-gray-800">
        {% for section in release.sections %}
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 {{ 'mt-0' if loop.first else 'mt-4' }}">{{ section.heading }}</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              {% for item in section.items %}
                <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                  <span class="mt-2 size-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-600"></span>
                  <span>{{ item | safe }}</span>
                </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
<p class="mt-10 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Upcoming work is on the <a href="/roadmap/" class="text-primary-ink hover:underline dark:text-primary">roadmap</a>. Full notes also live on <a href="https://github.com/shellui/shellui/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md" class="text-primary-ink hover:underline dark:text-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p>
